{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>לחוף ימים.</b> This too is a sign, for this is the way of prophecy. And the meaning of לחוף is a haven, and it is from the same root as \"חופף עליו כל היום\" (Deuteronomy 33:12), for ships do not stand in an exposed place to the wind." "<b>וירכתו על צידון.</b> That his thigh reaches unto Sidon:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:26.514697357Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}